{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56536","headline":"还丹歌 五 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老翁老婆造大药，铅汞二金用不错。\n出汤入火少精神，半生半死相依约。\n依约由来一甲子，上阴下阳相伏矣，世上喧喧若得之，鬼官不收免生死。\n铅是铅，汞是汞，世上人人緫能用。\n草黄芽，木黄芽，世上人人緫谩夸。\n自古口传不形纸，烧者徒劳尽破家。\n（按：此诗末八句与轩辕集《还丹口诀》中八句相近，见本书卷三十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}